<!--
  Loaded only when the bundled "Web Browser (JCEF)" plugin (com.intellij.modules.jcef) is present,
  via the optional <depends> in plugin.xml. Intentionally contributes nothing: that dependency
  exists purely so this plugin's classloader can see org.cef.* / com.intellij.ui.jcef.* on
  IntelliJ 2026.2+ (issue #66), where JCEF moved out of the JetBrains Runtime into that plugin.

  Do NOT move the preview's <fileEditorProvider> here. If the registration were conditional on
  JCEF, disabling that plugin would drop the split editor entirely and .zul would open with no
  preview pane and no explanation; keeping it in plugin.xml lets the pane show the JcefAvailability
  card that tells the user which plugin to re-enable.
-->
<idea-plugin/>
